'''Sweep the Area''' (一斉掃射, ''Issei Sōsha'', '''Strafing''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]].

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (Sm): Cat Cannon will charge 10 seconds faster.

